{"availability":"available","full":"NoGod3524/betterhuskyct","name":"betterhuskyct","description":"Turn your HuskyCT / Blackboard ICS calendar into a clean, private deadline dashboard — rolling 7-day view, completion tracking, workload insights, and an English/中文 toggle. Next.js 16 · TypeScript · Tailwind CSS.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-02T02:09:10Z","updated":"2026-10-11T00:07:00Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://huskypilot.vercel.app","topics":["icalendar","nextjs","productivity","student","tailwindcss","typescript","uconn","vercel"],"demo":"https://betterhuskyct.vercel.app/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T00:24:39.223Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T00:24:39.223Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T00:24:39.223Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T15:45:47.453Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-08T16:05:27.313Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-11T00:24:39.223Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Your course deadlines, organized. Bring a calendar from any LMS or calendar app — paste its private ICS link, or drop a downloaded .ics file — and get one calm, ordered view of what's due next.","Students track deadlines across an LMS, a syllabus, and email. BetterHuskyCT turns the calendar feed you already have into a single rolling 7-day list, so \"what's due next\" is one glance instead of a scavenger hunt.","It is deliberately small and privacy-first: no NetID, no password, no scraping, no account."],"features":["Import any ICS calendar — drop a downloaded .ics file anywhere on the page, or paste a private feed URL; several at once is fine","Courses named for you — a Blackboard feed titles a class meeting Environmental Science and never says which course it is, so the app looks the title up in UConn's public course catalogue and fills in NRE 1000E itself.…","Sync to your phone without a server — Sync packs the calendars, your ticks, your courses and the announcements the helper brought in into one link (about 3,100 characters for a term of 120 deadlines and 40…","Several calendars, several courses — HuskyCT issues one feed per course, so add as many as you have; file each under a course (code plus LEC / DIS / LAB / SEM), and every task shows its course, whether it is a class…","Rolling 7-day view — Today / Tomorrow / This week, grouped and time-sorted"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/NoGod3524/betterhuskyct/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"7385ddd9a75858baf7f0f377648c1b85de9f44fd14063793b135e85bb5ef7826","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T15:45:47.590Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T16:09:11.865Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Your course deadlines, organized. Bring a calendar from any LMS or calendar app — paste its private ICS link, or drop a downloaded .ics file — and get one calm, ordered view of what's due next.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/NoGod3524/betterhuskyct/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"documented","text":"It is deliberately small and privacy-first: no NetID, no password, no scraping, no account.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/NoGod3524/betterhuskyct/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"documented","text":"Privacy by design — no NetID, no password, no account.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/NoGod3524/betterhuskyct/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"7385ddd9a75858baf7f0f377648c1b85de9f44fd14063793b135e85bb5ef7826","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/NoGod3524/betterhuskyct/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T16:09:11.866Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-08T14:47:09Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/NoGod3524/betterhuskyct/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T16:09:11.868Z","hash":"7385ddd9a75858baf7f0f377648c1b85de9f44fd14063793b135e85bb5ef7826","originalBytes":27509,"storedBytes":27509,"truncated